      scenario: ['A task app notifies users when a task is assigned. Tapping a notification or an HTTPS task link must open the correct task, including from a cold start or signed-out state, without exposing a previous account’s cached task.'],
      functional: ['Register and refresh push tokens, display task notifications when permitted, and route both notifications and verified App Links to a task detail screen.', 'Preserve a validated pending destination through login and process recreation. Handle removed tasks, wrong accounts and unavailable network with explicit states.'],
